        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 14cedf30-b652-4095-8904-f265da1d6571).Image",
        "Description": "Cornelia Stuyvesant, once ashamed of who her father was, has had a change of heart and is looking to restart Providence. She plans to do so with the help of Sheikh Omar Al-Ghazali. Stuyvesant wishes to partner with Al-Ghazali to restart Providence. She is meeting with Gulshan Yazdani, an emissary of the Sheikh, under the cover of a garden show at Dartmoor, the birthplace of Providence, to open negotiations. Eliminate Cornelia and send a message to Omar Al-Ghazali by eliminating Gulshan.",
